      {
        "id": 1616,
        "name": "Mortal Kombat: Armageddon",
        "summary": "Mortal Kombat: Armageddon brags a roster of 62 characters and sees the return of classic ones from the original Mortal Kombat, such as Reptile, Shang Tsung and Goro. The enhanced Konquest mode (story/adventure mode) improves over the preceding versions, but has a shorter length. There are now 64 arenas (including revamped versions of classic environments) which each have their own tweaks, such as the ridiculous amount of stage fatalities (fatalities are a fancy way of killing your opponent, including classic techniques such as the \"spine-rip\" or \"arm-break\").",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y0j.jpg",
