        "id": 5908,
        "name": "Malice",
        "summary": "In this action-adventure platformer you play the part of Malice. Malice starts the game being resurrected by Death himself and it is explained that she is actually a demi-goddess who has stripped of her powers. Hell-bent on revenge, you must help Malice traverse many worlds armed with a variety of weapons; including the Mace of Clubs, the Clockwork Hammer and the Quantum Tuning Fork. Malice can also learn and use elemental magic to help her overcome many hazards. Can you help Malice beat the rising Crow Army to reach the evil Dog God and restore the shattered world once more?",
