        "id": 5982,
        "name": "Pirates of the Caribbean",
        "summary": "Pirates of the Caribbean is a role-playing game in which the player takes the role of a pirate who has to grow in skill by fighting, trading and solving quests. The player can buy and upgrade a ship, sign-up a crew, and try to rule the seas of the Caribbean.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45j9.jpg",
