        "name": "Tron 2.0",
        "summary": "An unknown viral agent threatens the future of computer systems worldwide. Countermeasure programs have scanned the system and have wrongly identified you as the virus source. Your mission is to prevent the sinister conspiracy that threatens to corrupt one reality, and forever transform another.\n\nOver 35 levels of challenging gameplay -- Race at the speed of light, fight off computer Viruses and engage in violent digital combat.",
