      {
        "id": 23793,
        "name": "Mortal Kombat: Armageddon - Premium Edition",
        "summary": "Available exclusively on the PlayStation 2, the Mortal Kombat: Armageddon -- Premium Editions (there are four variations) feature a number of bonuses from the series' renown history. All of the MK: Armageddon Premium Editions feature metallic packaging, three depicting the series favorite characters (Sindel & Shao Kahn, Johnny Cage & Goro, and Kano & Sonya), and the fourth with a variation of the MK: Armageddon retail box art.\nIncluded in the Premium Edition are an arcade–perfect version of the original Ultimate Mortal Kombat 3, a DVD video featuring a \"History of Fatalities\" movie along with new videos for more than 50 of the Mortal Kombat characters, and animation cell cover art autographed by franchise co–creator, Ed Boon",
