        "summary": "The second of two DLC packs released for Ninja Gaiden (2004) for the Xbox. This one features the same additions as the first Hurricane Pack, such as free camera control and the Intercept technique which would be cut from later releases. While the first Hurricane Pack was a variation on the main campaign with new weapons and such, this one is a multi-phase gauntlet of enemies that would serve as the basis for the Mission Mode in Ninja Gaiden Black.\n\nJust as with the first Hurricane Pack, this is no longer available to download due to the closure of Xbox Live for the original Xbox in 2010. It is now only accessible through a modded Xbox system or a console that still contains a save file.",
